flowchart LR
  U[Operator / Judge] --> UI[Static Next.js Command Center on S3 / CloudFront]
  UI -->|POST scenario / GET history| API[API Gateway HTTP API]
  API --> L[Scenario Lambda: validate + deterministic assess + response brief]
  L --> D[(DynamoDB ScenarioRunsTable)]
  L -->|HeatFloodScenarioAssessed| EB[EventBridge scenario bus]
  EB --> R[EventBridge rule]
  R --> SF[Step Functions Standard workflow]
  SF --> T[Workflow Task Lambda]
  T -->|Mark processed, retry-safe| D
  L --> CW[CloudWatch structured logs + Lambda metrics]
  T --> CW
  L -. ML unavailable .-> F[Deterministic fallback]
  F --> UI
